    "title": "Douglas County District Attorney's Office to Dismiss Case Against Julius Beasley - NewsBreak",
    "text": "15 hours ago Today, the Douglas County District Attorney’s Office announced it is dismissing without prejudice charges against Julius Beasley in DG-2024-CR-180. In November 2024, following a preliminary hearing Julius Beasley was arraigned on charges including murder in the first degree for the killing of Crystal Marie White at the Lawrence Camp New Beginnings in February of 2024. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
